      "widgets_values": [
        "上下装全换：Dress the person in <image1> in the complete outfit from <image2>, replacing both the top and bottom garments. Keep the facial features, hairstyle, and pose of the person in <image1> completely unchanged — only change the clothing. Faithfully reproduce the material, color, texture, cut, and style of both the upper and lower garments from <image2>, while ensuring the new outfit drapes naturally on the person in <image1> with consistent lighting. Keep the overall style unified with the original image.\n\n换上装：Dress the person in <image1> in the upper garment from <image2>, replacing only the top. Keep the original lower garment (pants/skirt) of the person in <image1> unchanged, along with their facial features, hairstyle, and pose. Faithfully reproduce the material, color, texture, cut, and style of the top from <image2>, while ensuring it drapes naturally on the person in <image1> with consistent lighting. Keep the overall style unified with the original image.\n\n换下装：Dress the person in <image1> in the lower garment from <image2>, replacing only the bottom (pants/skirt). Keep the original upper garment of the person in <image1> unchanged, along with their facial features, hairstyle, and pose. Faithfully reproduce the material, color, texture, cut, and style of the lower garment from <image2>, while ensuring it drapes naturally on the person in <image1> with consistent lighting. Keep the overall style unified with the original image.\n\n换身体：body_swap: start with <image1> as the base image, keeping its lighting, environment, and background. replace the body from <image1> with the body from <image2>, strictly preserving the clothing, body shape and proportions from <image2>. strictly replicate the exact pose, arm positions, leg positions, hand gestures, head rotation, eye direction and micro expressions from <image1>"
